ft-footed, worthy of being called elite fighters. When they are buried, the famiglia might send a letter of condolence home, nothing more.","abilities":["Increases Blood Debt by a miniscule amount when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":4400,"atk":375,"def":180,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.8}},"famiglia_terrorizer":{"slug":"famiglia_terrorizer","name":"Famiglia Terrorizer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Terrorizer.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"An exceptionally herculean famiglia strongman, known for his fiery temper. He does not begrudge the visits he pays to the relatives of others, but during key moments, his word is more resolute than stone.","abilities":["More likely to be attacked by allied units","Increases Blood Debt when defeated"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":600,"def":1100,"res":10,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"pathfinder_legionarius_prefect":{"slug":"pathfinder_legionarius_prefect","name":"Pathfinder Legionarius Prefect","icon":"/enemies-icons/Pathfinder Legionarius Prefect.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A powerful warrior who has flocked to the Guide, inspired by his philosophy. Fights to bring the common goal of the Pathfinders to fruition.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":4800,"atk":400,"def":200,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.5}},"none_of_my_business":{"slug":"none_of_my_business","name":"'None of My Business'","icon":"/enemies-icons/'None of My Business'.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":null,"damageType":["No Damage"],"flavourText":"A drunken man wobbling around with his hat pulled low. The incendiary bombs lying around the battlefield have nothing to do with him. At least, that's what he's always insisted in his affidavits.","abilities":["After losing a certain percentage of HP, releases a permanent incendiary field","Friendly Operators inside the field take True damage every second"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":30000,"atk":null,"def":200,"res":0,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"famiglia_silencer":{"slug":"famiglia_silencer","name":"Famiglia Silencer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Famiglia Silencer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A powerful assassin loyal to his famiglia, striking from the shadows before vanishing again, leaving only death in his wake. His title is known by all, but none dare speak of him.","abilities":["Gains additional buffs while under Asset Liquidation","Invisible"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":800,"def":800,"res":45,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":3}},"renowned_pathfinder_dessert_vendor":{"slug":"renowned_pathfinder_dessert_vendor","name":"Renowned Pathfinder Dessert Vendor","icon":"/enemies-icons/Renowned Pathfinder Dessert Vendor.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Machina","movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Seems to be an ordinary street vendor. However, their carts are likely loaded with more than just snacks. Those who anger them will soon learn the true meaning of fear.","abilities":["While this unit is holding Ammo, periodically summons a <Luscious Snack Cart>. Ammo capacity: 3","Deals significantly increased damage to enemies blocking this unit"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":22500,"atk":600,"def":650,"res":30,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"father_agenir":{"slug":"father_agenir","name":"Father Agenir","icon":"/enemies-icons/Father Agenir.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Agenir, Sankta priest, one of the founders of Siracusa's ironclad order. Do not hesitate–though he does not necessarily stand opposed to you, his guns speak first. By the way, his favorite eye mask was made in Lungmen.","abilities":["Gradually increases Blood Debt","Attacks have global range when Asset Liquidation is active","Attacks using Ammo decrease the target's DEF. Ammo capacity: 10"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":true,"moveSpeed":1,"stats":{"hp":80000,"atk":1100,"def":650,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4.5}},"andoain_the_martyr":{"slug":"andoain_the_martyr","name":"Andoain, the 'Martyr'","icon":"/enemies-icons/Andoain, the 'Martyr'.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A Sankta who made an enemy of Laterano for the sake of asking a question. A Pathfinder who tread the path of peril for the sake of receiving an answer. He feels neither wrath nor sorrow. He neither curses God, nor beseeches man. Andoain only follows his own path, wherever it may end.","abilities":["Cannot be blocked.","While this unit is holding Ammo, ATK increases. Ammo capacity: 5","While this unit is holding Ammo, gains increased ATK and attacks will cause bullets to bounce to nearby targets up to 5 times, dealing additional damage to 'Gelato Stops'","First Form","[Light Unto Sufferers] Whenever a certain percentage of HP is lost, creates a permanent field effect. Enemies standing on affected tiles take reduced Physical and Arts damage and gain 50% Physical and Arts dodge","Second Form","After being defeated once, enters his Second Form, gaining increased ATK","[Ashes to Ashes, Dust to Dust] Andoain stops attacking and scans the battlefield from left to right, locking onto at most 5 targets before dealing massive Physical damage to them and fully replenishing his Ammo","Whenever a low percentage of HP is lost, unleashes the permanent terrain effect [Light Unto Sufferers]"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":27000,"atk":750,"def":550,"res":60,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"zaaro_signore_dei_lupi":{"slug":"zaaro_signore_dei_lupi","name":"Zaaro, Signore dei Lupi","icon":"/enemies-icons/Zaaro, Signore dei Lupi.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"Il Signore dei Lupi was born in the wilderness, but he has cast his gaze upon the world of men. His hubris is boundless, yet he falls short. His tricks exhausted, he has lost everything. Now, someone must be made to bear his wrath.","abilities":["Gradually increases Blood Debt","First Form","Damage taken is reduced and cannot be Stunned","[Hemolytic Horror] Causes 3 friendly units to be consumed by fear, greatly reducing their ASPD, significantly accelerating their periodic HP loss, and causing them to be unable to be retreated manually; affected units will return to normal after 'Signore dei Lupi' loses a certain percentage of HP","After the first form reaches 0 HP, gains [Primal Deterrence], reducing the ASPD of nearby friendly units, and slowly gaining HP over time","Second Form","No longer has Damage Reduction, and longer casts [Hemolytic Horror]","Attacks become ranged and strike twice, and gains increased ATK","Periodically releases a [Furious Howl], causing Blood Debt to increase rapidly"],"levelCount":2,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6